    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 2791 reported a gross prior year reserve release of GBP 16.1 million for the 2020 year, representing a 5.0% release of its 2019 opening gross claims outstanding. This favourable development was primarily driven by releases in long-tail casualty classes (GBP 5.4m), short-tail accounts (GBP 4.5m, including property catastrophe events), and motor and other miscellaneous specialty classes (GBP 6.2m, largely from the Irish motor account). Specific events contributing to releases included favourable legal rulings for Superstorm Sandy and a successful arbitration for a Canadian wildfire reinsurance contract. However, some adverse development was noted for Hurricane Irma and the 2017 catastrophes (Harvey, Irma, Maria, Californian Wildfires).",
